# Phone-builder path, four fictional long-label questions; no Claude session or runner is started.
fold folded
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview
shell am start -n dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview/.PreviewActivity --es waitingQuestion builder
clearlog
expect Questions waiting
tap answer questions
expect Questions · 4
scrollto Choice 1:
tap Choice 1:
scrollto Choice 2:
tap Choice 2:
scrollto Choice 3:
tap Choice 3:
scrollto Choice 4:
expect Send answers
nolog phone builder question allow
shot builder-question-four-cover
rotate landscape
expect Send answers
shot builder-question-four-landscape
rotate portrait
scrollto Choice 4:
tap Choice 4:
expect Answers sent
log phone builder question allow updatedInput answers4
shot builder-question-four-sent
fold unfolded
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview
shell am start -n dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview/.PreviewActivity --es waitingQuestion builder
clearlog
tap answer questions
scrollto Choice 1:
tap Choice 1:
scrollto Choice 2:
tap Choice 2:
swipe 0.78 0.55 0.78 0.30 400
scrollto Choice 3:
tap Choice 3:
swipe 0.78 0.70 0.78 0.15 500
scrollto Choice 4:
expect Send answers
shot builder-question-four-unfolded
tap Choice 4:
expect Answers sent
log phone builder question allow updatedInput answers4
[phone] After combined install: owner asks a phone builder one harmless four-question AskUserQuestion. From the notification Answer questions opens that builder's exact native form, never generic Approve/Deny. Owner selects all four, presses Send answers without sending a chat message, sees receipt and builder receives all four in its tool result without interruption. Do not answer any real financial decision in this walk. Stop/withdraw must show expired rather than claim delivered; no replay or other-builder answer.
